<h1>Elsewhere</h1>
<div class="row">
<div>
<p class="tag">Go somewhere you haven’t been yet.</p>
<p class="s">A small crew of curious students who learn strange new skills, chase odd ideas, and leave every week with something real.</p>
<a class="btn" href="#join">Request a passport</a>
</div>
